{"name": "Skewer of Heroes: Bubble Survivors", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/85c91d0d561a887ee208f7d058a87fe8.avif?t=1751250189\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character has unique skills and attributes that can be strategically combined based on the needs of battle. Whether you choose a powerful melee warrior or a spellcasting mage, you\u2019ll find a role that suits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"436\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/eae6d1970c2523bf2ec218839f527e52.poster.avif?t=1751250189\" width=\"792\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/eae6d1970c2523bf2ec218839f527e52.webm?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/eae6d1970c2523bf2ec218839f527e52.mp4?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/d07acf3719c651bef6823fa4f960fea6.avif?t=1751250189\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can choose to form a circle to enhance your attack or line up in a row to increase your speed. With simple switching mechanics, you can quickly respond to the ever-changing battle conditions and fully unleash your team\u2019s potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"436\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/3f17829d1d9af9c2154bb4637fe972de.poster.avif?t=1751250189\" width=\"792\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/3f17829d1d9af9c2154bb4637fe972de.webm?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/3f17829d1d9af9c2154bb4637fe972de.mp4?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/934c889fce7b265c44e53d12263b383a.avif?t=1751250189\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different playstyles complement each other, allowing for rich combat strategies. Explore various possibilities, discover hidden combinations, and find the best synergies to showcase your heroes\u2019 extraordinary strength and style in battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/776145ab61053a1da16fe47becad2e60.poster.avif?t=1751250189\" width=\"790\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/776145ab61053a1da16fe47becad2e60.webm?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/776145ab61053a1da16fe47becad2e60.mp4?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/54fba533ce0edd3708d0b9dbfeedbfb9.avif?t=1751250189\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience fast-paced, rhythmic combat where every attack delivers a powerful impact. With fluid movements and stunning skill effects, enjoy an addictive, high-speed battle experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/930e69e398e03372c6310661bbfad79b.poster.avif?t=1751250189\" width=\"790\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/930e69e398e03372c6310661bbfad79b.webm?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/930e69e398e03372c6310661bbfad79b.mp4?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Bubble Survivor is a hack-and-slash game that combines Roguelike elements with team-based gameplay. You will summon like-minded heroes to conquer challenges and defeat the malevolent slimes, restoring light to the world!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/0b45271993ebeb267540a35b723d094d653b4ae4/header.jpg?t=1751250189", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Action Roguelike", "Bullet Hell", "Survival", "Roguelike", "Casual"], "developers": "White Star Studio", "publishers": "White Star Studio", "release_date": "Jun 3, 2025", "price": "$4.99", "appid": "3251240", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "10 February 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Oc2_bObjrbA", "first_seen": 1739142000.0, "review_rank": 1853}